  "description": "Class library adding client-side support for Push Notification when the client is not connected over XMPP. Implemented for the XMPP Client library defined in Waher.Networking.XMPP. Push Notification provided by the TAG Neuron. Allows the client to forward different types of messages, and contents, into different notification channels, as defined by mobile platforms, when client is offline.",
